WEBVTT

00:06:27.674 --> 00:06:30.221
They talk about the theology of love.

00:06:30.245 --> 00:06:32.181
But when you're on a bus

00:06:32.205 --> 00:06:34.068
in Anniston, Alabama,

00:06:34.092 --> 00:06:36.491
or in Montgomery, Alabama, as you've been,

00:06:36.515 --> 00:06:40.352
surrounded by that mob
and surrounded by that hate,

00:06:40.376 --> 00:06:44.481
surrounded by people who you know
are prepared to do violent things,

00:06:44.505 --> 00:06:46.278
it's a different dynamic.

00:06:46.302 --> 00:06:48.454
JL: Yeah. I accepted that.

00:06:48.866 --> 00:06:51.813
Dr. King taught us to love.

00:06:51.837 --> 00:06:53.786
It's in keeping with my Christian faith

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.349
to love everybody

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:56.553
and never hate,

00:06:56.577 --> 00:06:59.301
because the hate was
too heavy a burden to bear.

00:06:59.325 --> 00:07:01.489
BS: But it seems like
you were strategic, too.